<template compat="shopify">
{%- comment -%}
  Materia Themes. Opt-out attributes for Theme settings > Typography "Use in
  every section" (snippets/theme-controls), printed on the text-grid root.
  Custom fonts on: data-own-font, so the section's own heading and body
  fonts win over the theme's (the root and everything in it). A heading
  weight of the section's own (the heading font's weight, or Image With Text
  Multirow's Heading weight): data-own-weight. Off: nothing, the theme wins.
  media-live-text-grid.js toggles the same attributes live.
  Use: <div ... {% render 'media-tg-own', st: st %}>
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign own_weight = false
  if st.enable_custom_fonts and st.heading_font.weight != blank
    assign own_weight = true
  endif
  if st.heading_weight != blank and st.heading_weight != 'theme'
    assign own_weight = true
  endif
-%}
{%- if st.enable_custom_fonts %} data-own-font{% endif -%}
{%- if own_weight %} data-own-weight{% endif -%}
</template>
